{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/f2ef63446e371a0c6b751541673d093a.avif?t=1771878531\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>Doctor Viscera</i></strong> is a survival horror game where you must escape the abandoned GrimmHaus asylum while evading the monstrous Doctor Viscera and his grotesque experiments.  <br>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/b0574a09c4a11cfdc2ea35732d2ecbb5.poster.avif?t=1771878531\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/b0574a09c4a11cfdc2ea35732d2ecbb5.webm?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/b0574a09c4a11cfdc2ea35732d2ecbb5.mp4?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>\u00a0</i></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong><i>Descent Into Madness...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After seeking shelter inside the forgotten GrimmHaus Asylum, you awaken alone, trapped in a decaying nightmare.    <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/bfe6beaf5726cddd26486f4d6d0475b4.poster.avif?t=1771878531\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/bfe6beaf5726cddd26486f4d6d0475b4.webm?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/bfe6beaf5726cddd26486f4d6d0475b4.mp4?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore, Solve, Survive...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for key items, solve puzzles, and unlock new areas as you desperately try to escape. But be careful, every wrong turn could lead straight into Doctor\u2019s grasp.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/e94b23e65070601024862e64cd91784e.poster.avif?t=1771878531\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/e94b23e65070601024862e64cd91784e.webm?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/e94b23e65070601024862e64cd91784e.mp4?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Five Never-Ending Nightmares...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have five nights to survive. Use your wits, stay silent, and don't let your fear consume you. <br> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/7e77f3b800362511c5309378d8f9d4fe.poster.avif?t=1771878531\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/7e77f3b800362511c5309378d8f9d4fe.webm?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/7e77f3b800362511c5309378d8f9d4fe.mp4?t=1771878531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the horrors of GrimmHaus... or will you become just anoth